ration's  demand for irreversible denuclearization  without direct economic aid from the US  also appears to have suddenly earth the  North Koreans who call the u.s. rhetoric  reckless and sinister  but the regime does appear to still be  following through on its promise to  destroy its main nuclear testing site  new satellite images shows several  buildings at the site have been torn  down North Korea abruptly pulled out of  a meeting with South Korea today at the  DMZ saying it's upset about ongoing  military exercises being conducted by  the South Koreans and the United States  now all of this could just be a  negotiating ploy by the North Koreans  going into this summit with President  Trump trying to remind the world that  North Korea is not going to be pushed  around Ben Tracy in Beijing thank you
 

